## API reference

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `effect:` | `:shimmer`, `:pulse`, `:none` | `:shimmer` | The animation; all stop under `prefers-reduced-motion`. |

`class:` shapes, rounds and tints it; other attributes go to the `<div>`.

## Accessibility

- It's `aria-hidden` - screen readers skip the placeholder geometry.
- Announce the loading state on the container instead: `aria-busy="true"` while it loads (and a polite
  `role="status"` region if the arrival should be announced).
- Keep the skeleton's footprint close to the real content's, so swapping it in causes no layout shift.
